WEBVTT

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:38.116
Far, far away in the future.

00:00:39.084 --> 00:00:41.284
Mutants and monsters lurk around.

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:43.304
夜の世界のもの

00:00:43.564 --> 00:00:45.564
Thank you for watching.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.788
You

00:02:05.788 --> 00:02:06.788
Thank you.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:30.640
Thank you.

00:08:35.244 --> 00:08:36.784
That sword is a decoration!

00:08:37.292 --> 00:08:38.932
I don't care if I get it!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.170
As I thought, it was just a mere sight.

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:07.450
Now, put your hands on the ground and let's go!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.300
I'm sorry for what I did wrong. I wanted to see your arm.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:42.170
I'll hire you.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:50.750
It's my family's blood.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:10.180
What's your name?

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:12.480
Drislan.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:14.280
Will you accept me?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.100
I'll pay you back.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.240
Three meals a day.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.310
And then...

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.270
You can choose whatever you want.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.930
When were you killed by the nobles?

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.010
Will you accept me?

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.760
Brother, you don't talk much, do you?

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:36.640
Teringo sensei said that there are two types of silent men.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.170
One who thinks bad things and is silent,

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:43.220
or one who has various experiences and doesn't say unnecessary things.

00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:49.200
Brother is the latter one.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.890
That's good.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:16.540
And that's it.

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:49.440
Yo!

00:12:49.676 --> 00:12:50.396
DORIS!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:55.720
As I thought, the rumor is true.

00:12:59.436 --> 00:12:59.996
That's what I'm saying.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.840
I have something to tell you.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:14.890
What is it?

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.870
I'm telling you that you were attacked by an actor.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:23.090
Hey, don't make a big voice.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:28.120
Can I hear it from my brother, Doris?

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.130
Why didn't you talk to me?

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.320
I'm the village chief's son.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.620
I'm going to hire a better hunter than that hunter.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.920
I'll keep an eye on you the other day.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.020
Listen to me.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:51.500
What are you doing?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.860
Don't do anything you're used to.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.550
Doris, I'm worried about you.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:00.800
I'm telling you to help him.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.540
Even if you owe me, it won't go that way.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.060
Because of you, I know a lot of people who have had a terrible experience.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:13.360
Even if you're angry, you're cute, so I can't help it.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.390
Listen to what I have to say quietly.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:17.850
You bastard!

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:19.410
I'm going to kill you!

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:37.780
Huh? Aniki?

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.700
Everyone! Listen to me!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.660
The Dries was attacked by a bad guy!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.150
He was attacked by a vampire!

00:15:14.876 --> 00:15:16.476
You're a hunter, aren't you?

00:15:18.172 --> 00:15:18.672
That's right.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:22.780
Omurice, you...

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:28.460
Rei-chan...

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.980
As I thought, as I said

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.560
No, it's not like that!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:34.880
It's because I was dumped by my sister!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.780
What did you say? You bastard!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.120
Furuyako!

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:41.780
Father, they made fun of me!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.800
I'm talking about the village now.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.040
Get out of here!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:50.300
Anyway, I can't let you go because you were bitten by a vampire.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.200
I'm going to the police station.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:54.380
Wait a minute.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.370
That prison is not a place for humans. It's more like a pigsty.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:05.980
I'm against it as a doctor.

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.260
Besides, they've been there for 50 years.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.280
That's not right, Doctor. This is a village.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.580
Do you remember what happened there 50 years ago?

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.050
What happened 50 years ago?

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:26.380
A woman was attacked by a noble like Doris.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:29.960
She was imprisoned in the prison, but the white-haired...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.120
and killed 30 villagers.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:38.530
What happened to that woman?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.180
She died in the hospital.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:49.680
I can't wait until my job is done to deal with Doris.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:55.560
I'm confident, but I'm going to fight the vampire.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.230
If I fail...

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:02.360
I'll take care of myself.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:02.960
Sister.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:03.800
Good.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:28.480
One month's worth of food and five packs of dried fish.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.900
And canned food.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.060
I'm sorry, but everyone's dead.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:35.630
Waitress!

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.450
Waitress, what are you talking about?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.800
There are so many dead people here.

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:43.460
Teacher, all the other customers have run away.

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.380
I can't sell things to the vampire's friends.

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:47.870
What?

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.320
There's something worse coming up.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:55.210
I know you're crying.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:56.920
I hope you like it.

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.820
But only my sister is crying.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:04.640
If you feel like your sister is about to cry, then be patient.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.420
Even if something bad happens, smile and encourage your sister.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.350
You are a man.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.800
What's wrong with you today?

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:09.070
It's not like you always do.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:13.560
You're taking care of this girl and encouraging your little brother.

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.450
What kind of wind is blowing?

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.450
Don't tell me you fell in love with this girl.

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:24.200
That's right.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.540
Even if your daughter gives you her body,

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.580
You don't want that kind of thing.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:28.880
I can't believe it.

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.310
The only enemy of the nobility is the nobility.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:34.490
The fate given to you by the blood-stained way of life.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:37.250
I'm envious of the warmth of people.

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:40.480
A man like you.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.650
Thank you for the afternoon.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:46.360
You said something to Dan, didn't you?

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.490
That child is always trying to encourage me.

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:51.940
My father was also a hunter.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.880
War Wolf Hunter.

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:56.590
But I didn't know anything about the nobility.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.440
Ask the vampire hunter about the nobility.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.640
The other hunters won't be of any use.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.640
My father always said that.

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:06.490
D, tell me about the nobility.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:09.070
Tomorrow is the woman's moon.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:10.770
The woman's moon?

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:12.660
The red moon that is one day a month?

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:15.260
The nobility hates vampires as the moon in which the blood of immortals flows.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:20.150
That means they might be welcomed from the castle tonight.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:22.650
What is the status of the nobility here?

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.030
D is a white knight.

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.360
He said that he had been in charge of this village for a long time.

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:28.900
It seems that he was gone for a long time.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.680
It's strange, but I found out that I came back to the castle two years ago with the light on.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:38.060
It is said that the city is 50,000 years old or 10,000 years old.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.530
Either way, it seems to be a year that makes you feel distant.

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:47.800
10,000 years old? It seems to be a troublesome opponent.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:29.400
Natsura no Kita

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:34.730
How are you fighting?

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:35.630
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:40.180
They're not going to die.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:45.860
They're not going to die.

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:35.250
You hired a servant?

00:22:36.590 --> 00:22:37.070
Aha!

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:39.610
That's what a lowly woman would think.

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:41.240
A woman, huh?

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:43.460
What happened to her?

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:46.100
The daughter of this place

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:48.650
is a rare beauty

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:49.090
for a local.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:50.510
Her father was told

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:51.210
that her tongue would melt,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.120
so he went to see her.

00:22:54.620 --> 00:22:56.700
But she's still a foolish woman.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:58.860
We don't have to thank the ruler.

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:01.570
I won't allow you to commit such a heinous crime!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:04.290
First, I'll send you to the blood festival,

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:06.440
and then I'll take care of this girl here.

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:11.870
Yes, I am the Reiginsei.

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.310
It is my duty to kill people like you.

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:16.060
Prepare yourself.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:45.230
I'll do it more than I thought.

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:47.860
Then I'll do it with that intention.

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:28.440
I heard that there's a mutant who can distort time.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.760
I'm sorry.

00:24:33.970 --> 00:24:34.630
It was a pity.

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:36.400
Let's drink.

00:24:37.260 --> 00:24:38.020
What?

00:24:43.600 --> 00:24:44.480
Beer.

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:57.630
But, my lady.

00:24:57.910 --> 00:24:58.050
Yes.

00:25:01.820 --> 00:25:03.850
I understand, my lady.

00:25:04.290 --> 00:25:07.810
Rampir, I've never seen you before.

00:25:07.890 --> 00:25:09.160
You're a nobleman of a noble family.

00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:10.950
You're a scum of a lowly woman.

00:25:11.910 --> 00:25:13.240
You're worse than humans.

00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:17.670
My daughter, I have business with a white man.

00:25:18.570 --> 00:25:20.970
I have no intention of killing you.

00:25:33.840 --> 00:25:37.970
Go back to the castle and tell the Count.

00:25:38.910 --> 00:25:42.480
It is the duty of the guest to return to the darkness.

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:45.260
The guest to return to the darkness?

00:26:03.070 --> 00:26:04.490
Lameica and the others are back.

00:26:04.890 --> 00:26:10.140
They're doing whatever they want without my permission.

00:26:10.140 --> 00:26:15.390
They're chasing after Dampir.

00:26:15.850 --> 00:26:18.400
Lameica and Ray are being chased by Dampir.

00:26:21.870 --> 00:26:22.310
Interesting.

00:26:23.150 --> 00:26:25.200
They're having even more fun.

00:26:31.600 --> 00:26:34.780
Lord Dracula, my father is mistaken.

00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:40.380
My father is trying to marry the daughter of the noble Doris to the noble Rike.

00:26:41.320 --> 00:26:44.530
I cannot forgive a fool who would hurt the blood of a nobleman.

00:26:45.730 --> 00:26:47.560
Lord Dracula...

00:26:47.560 --> 00:26:54.290
Lady Lamica, please return to your room.

00:26:54.770 --> 00:26:56.140
I don't remember you telling me such a thing.

00:26:57.500 --> 00:26:59.960
I'm sorry for what I said earlier, Lord Dracula.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:00.760
I was scolded by my father.

00:27:00.760 --> 00:27:03.410
The young lady is forbidden to enter the room.

00:27:04.510 --> 00:27:06.000
Please come in.

00:27:06.260 --> 00:27:09.760
Rei, I won't allow you to touch me.

00:27:10.240 --> 00:27:13.390
I want to be a member of the royal family with my father.

00:27:13.750 --> 00:27:16.150
After all, you are also a lowly servant.

00:27:17.270 --> 00:27:20.010
I won't forgive you for spilling such dirty blood on my family.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.000
Thank you.

00:30:00.410 --> 00:30:02.030
Be careful. It's a trap.

00:30:02.350 --> 00:30:03.140
I know.

00:30:34.860 --> 00:30:35.120
Is that it?

00:31:01.400 --> 00:31:26.490
I see you again. I want to settle things here, but I have to take you to a place where you are.

00:32:18.940 --> 00:32:23.040
It's after the war 10,000 years ago.

00:32:23.300 --> 00:32:24.500
It's fitting for this world.

00:32:34.570 --> 00:32:34.710
Thank you.

00:34:00.920 --> 00:34:01.580
Who are you?

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:04.710
Why don't you answer?

00:34:09.310 --> 00:34:09.830
Who are you?

00:34:12.580 --> 00:34:13.570
Who are we?

00:34:30.350 --> 00:34:30.530
Oh!

00:34:31.180 --> 00:34:47.110
It's a snake king with a lot of evil and evil.

00:34:49.120 --> 00:34:51.160
Sister, it's been a long time since I've had something like this.

00:34:51.200 --> 00:34:52.720
I'll slowly taste the taste of a man.

00:34:53.880 --> 00:34:56.900
I'll get rid of the impurities in my bones.

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:24.400
Tris, don't worry. That man will come back. He's like a piece of steel. He won't be easily defeated.

00:35:25.540 --> 00:35:28.040
Tris, don't tell me that man...

00:35:31.790 --> 00:35:35.180
No! No way! That man is not the man you think he is!

00:35:35.340 --> 00:35:37.990
He's not a bad man, but he has dangerous eyes.

00:35:39.970 --> 00:35:40.650
Dangerous eyes?

00:35:41.200 --> 00:35:42.900
Those are the eyes of a man who always continues to fight whether he lives or dies.

00:35:44.800 --> 00:35:46.660
But he's not the kind of man to accept you.

00:36:18.490 --> 00:36:20.110
The white king is waiting for you.

00:36:20.110 --> 00:36:24.520
Too bad.

00:36:24.720 --> 00:36:26.130
They love raw meat.

00:36:30.890 --> 00:36:31.610
If you do that...

00:36:31.610 --> 00:36:37.090
It's an order from the lord to bring you back with no injury.

00:36:37.870 --> 00:36:39.370
Well, it can't be helped.

00:36:40.410 --> 00:36:41.730
That's all you have to do.

00:36:41.750 --> 00:36:42.910
It's vulgar.

00:36:51.180 --> 00:36:54.450
You'll be able to join the noble family tomorrow.

00:36:54.830 --> 00:36:55.550
Don't force yourself.

00:36:56.750 --> 00:36:57.330
What?

00:36:58.820 --> 00:36:59.640
All night.

00:37:00.730 --> 00:37:02.330
I'm going to say goodbye to the castle.

00:37:02.670 --> 00:37:06.430
You're so cute. You're my queen.

00:37:07.370 --> 00:37:09.110
I'll forgive you for your rude words.

00:37:10.330 --> 00:37:14.810
By the way, Doris, I think that hunter is still coming to save you.

00:37:32.650 --> 00:37:34.590
Those ebionnas have taken over that man's life.

00:37:35.570 --> 00:37:38.220
Look, they're at the peak of their pleasure.

00:37:38.360 --> 00:37:40.340
They've been waiting for more than half a day for that foolish pleasure.

00:37:42.600 --> 00:37:47.620
A normal man would be exhausted in just five minutes, but as expected of Dampier.

00:37:48.530 --> 00:37:53.970
You didn't know?

00:37:55.320 --> 00:37:57.660
We nobles were born in the water, and we were born with a lowly woman.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.350
What's wrong?

00:38:01.550 --> 00:38:03.180
Doris, take a good look.

00:38:03.380 --> 00:38:04.740
It must be a heart-throbbing sight.

00:38:05.620 --> 00:38:07.380
Stop it already!

00:38:08.490 --> 00:38:08.910
All right.

00:38:09.230 --> 00:38:11.670
Take a good rest in your bedroom tonight.

00:38:12.050 --> 00:38:19.870
The wedding ceremony is tomorrow.

00:38:20.130 --> 00:38:21.960
My dear Doris,

00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:23.240
tonight's moon seems to be two.

00:38:36.400 --> 00:38:40.970
What kind of man is this?

00:38:40.970 --> 00:38:43.430
Now we're going to be in trouble.

00:38:43.870 --> 00:38:45.970
We're going to be in trouble.

00:39:00.540 --> 00:39:00.880
This guy!

00:39:02.280 --> 00:39:24.420
Are you going to add me to the Lee family?

00:39:25.380 --> 00:39:28.160
Are you going to make this woman my mother?

00:39:47.880 --> 00:39:51.500
No matter how much you fight, you end up showing your fangs.

00:39:52.740 --> 00:39:55.940
You'll get angry again.

00:39:56.440 --> 00:39:58.360
It's up to you.

00:39:58.500 --> 00:39:59.100
Shit.

00:40:00.380 --> 00:40:01.620
Do you want to be cut off?

00:40:01.692 --> 00:40:03.232
Okay, I'll talk to you later

00:40:06.588 --> 00:40:08.948
Where is my father attracted to this woman?

00:40:09.788 --> 00:40:14.228
I, Lamica, will not allow myself to be a burden to the Li family.

00:42:30.250 --> 00:42:30.470
Thank you.

00:43:01.820 --> 00:43:02.080
Whoa!

00:43:32.400 --> 00:43:32.820
Gimlet?

00:43:33.000 --> 00:43:41.920
You can't go back to the castle until you kill him.

00:43:41.920 --> 00:43:42.320
Then...

00:44:01.240 --> 00:44:03.080
My brother is fixing the wall outside.

00:44:03.340 --> 00:44:05.100
But it's amazing.

00:44:05.780 --> 00:44:08.200
He's the only one who saved my sister from such a scary place.

00:44:10.940 --> 00:44:13.980
Besides, he hasn't been resting since he got home.

00:44:14.560 --> 00:44:16.860
He'll start working again as it is.

00:44:17.000 --> 00:44:20.890
Hey, it's a noble. It's a noble carriage.

00:44:21.150 --> 00:44:22.220
What's this place?

00:44:27.100 --> 00:44:29.360
Let's go to the hotel and drink again.

00:44:31.210 --> 00:44:32.050
You guys, get out of here!

00:44:33.400 --> 00:44:38.830
Hey, old man!

00:44:38.970 --> 00:44:40.430
I-I'm a nobleman's servant!

00:44:40.770 --> 00:44:42.020
I know.

00:44:42.420 --> 00:44:43.240
Give me the key to the monitor room.

00:44:44.060 --> 00:44:46.520
I am the servant of the Abbot.

00:44:48.960 --> 00:44:50.170
What do you want?

00:44:50.310 --> 00:44:51.930
Have you been ordered to execute me?

00:44:53.670 --> 00:44:55.050
No, no, not at all.

00:44:55.750 --> 00:44:58.560
I should be able to defeat you.

00:45:00.280 --> 00:45:04.210
It was the rule to protect the castle.

00:45:04.910 --> 00:45:14.520
The knight used this to defeat Ayatsu.

00:45:17.430 --> 00:45:19.820
That's not the spirit of the time.

00:45:21.330 --> 00:45:21.990
That's right.

00:45:22.950 --> 00:45:26.160
The spirit of the time.

00:45:44.140 --> 00:45:56.380
It's useless. It's like a code that only murderers know.

00:45:57.920 --> 00:45:59.810
Dan's life.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:05.100
If you want me to come alone, I'll separate you and me.

00:46:05.100 --> 00:46:08.440
Why don't you just tell me to come?

00:46:10.180 --> 00:46:13.180
You want to settle this with me, don't you?

00:46:13.650 --> 00:46:14.590
And one more thing.

00:46:14.810 --> 00:46:18.590
I'm asking you to raise a child for the sake of the nobility.

00:46:18.970 --> 00:46:21.140
The nobility?

00:46:21.320 --> 00:46:22.920
The nobility is the home of the people!

00:46:23.320 --> 00:46:29.800
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:32.780
As you know, I'm Dan Peel.

00:46:32.880 --> 00:46:36.460
I'm in cahoots with the aristocrats you're looking for.

00:46:36.460 --> 00:46:41.400
I'm sure they were quiet so we wouldn't have to worry about them.

00:46:42.220 --> 00:46:44.570
I'm glad we don't know each other.

00:46:44.970 --> 00:46:53.350
You're here.

00:46:53.590 --> 00:46:55.040
What's wrong with Dan?

00:47:02.910 --> 00:47:05.380
Boya, if you kill him, I'll take you down right away.

00:47:05.560 --> 00:47:06.610
Wait there quietly.

00:47:08.120 --> 00:47:16.000
Then I'll go.

00:47:33.900 --> 00:47:35.560
T, be careful. It's the enemy of Tokidamashi.

00:47:36.040 --> 00:47:39.200
Huh? The fire won't go out.

00:47:39.360 --> 00:47:57.410
It's a barefoot. It's Feringo.

00:47:58.670 --> 00:47:59.790
Doris Barrier's...

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:00.800
Come here, Captain.

00:48:06.170 --> 00:48:07.570
There's a patient in the village.

00:48:07.890 --> 00:48:08.510
Sorry.

00:48:09.310 --> 00:48:11.200
Come with me right away.

00:48:11.780 --> 00:48:15.670
But why are you brothers so...

00:48:15.670 --> 00:48:16.090
Ah!

00:48:17.970 --> 00:48:18.690
Someone's got my hand!

00:48:20.760 --> 00:48:22.970
You were caught by a fake king.

00:48:23.950 --> 00:48:25.720
You're not doing anything stupid.

00:48:26.400 --> 00:48:29.820
Damn it! You're making me feel bad!

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:32.000
Do you understand?

00:48:36.396 --> 00:48:37.256
Is there a place like this?

00:48:37.708 --> 00:48:40.428
Remember when you came back from Uncle Parker's house.

00:48:41.132 --> 00:48:42.692
I found it in Utano-mori.

00:48:43.116 --> 00:48:44.676
It's an ancient building.

00:48:44.676 --> 00:48:46.756
There's something written on the stone wall.

00:48:46.756 --> 00:48:50.376
Apparently, that's where the vampire shelter is.

00:48:51.276 --> 00:48:52.736
If you go there, you'll be saved.

00:48:53.196 --> 00:48:56.496
I'm sure he'll save me again.

00:48:57.004 --> 00:48:59.004
Thank you for watching.

00:49:02.970 --> 00:49:03.110
What?

00:49:03.350 --> 00:49:08.860
What are you doing?

00:49:11.660 --> 00:49:12.810
Doris, change the weapon.

00:49:12.950 --> 00:49:13.780
No, I can't.

00:49:13.960 --> 00:49:14.990
I'll do it.

00:49:23.690 --> 00:49:27.440
Hehehe, that's what you've been doing until yesterday.

00:49:28.820 --> 00:49:29.260
Teacher!

00:49:31.400 --> 00:49:40.240
Lady Lameka, why did you come here?

00:49:40.320 --> 00:49:44.210
In your plan, the castle will remain as it is.

00:49:44.210 --> 00:49:45.420
Put your daughter down.

00:49:45.920 --> 00:49:46.160
Yes.

00:49:47.060 --> 00:49:51.340
I thought this girl was like my own daughter until yesterday,

00:49:52.100 --> 00:49:55.940
but when I looked at her, she was so beautiful that it was strange that she didn't touch her.

00:49:56.260 --> 00:49:59.230
It's warm.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:01.500
What are you hiding?

00:50:01.820 --> 00:50:05.260
I'm begging you to spill the blood.

00:50:06.220 --> 00:50:07.320
Hey, you!

00:50:07.720 --> 00:50:08.080
What?

00:50:08.550 --> 00:50:09.210
Ah!

00:50:34.350 --> 00:50:35.310
死んでしまいた。

00:50:40.380 --> 00:50:41.780
全て父のやっとよいお前は父の目の届かぬ遠い地へ去れ。

00:51:14.300 --> 00:51:20.820
As expected, this child of the spirit of time is a white man who crushes only the eyes of the vampire.

00:51:21.420 --> 00:51:22.890
I can't believe you're suffering so much.

00:51:23.570 --> 00:51:24.690
Why are you doing that?

00:51:24.950 --> 00:51:27.860
More than that, I made the white knight's daughter my hostage.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:31.640
If you make a deal with me, everything will go well.

00:51:32.000 --> 00:51:33.390
What the hell are you doing?

00:51:33.530 --> 00:51:35.280
I'm going to lure the white king and get his life.

00:51:36.060 --> 00:51:37.390
It's easy if you have this time spirit.

00:51:38.730 --> 00:51:41.600
But you have to promise me that you'll be with me.

00:51:42.240 --> 00:51:45.000
If you don't want to, I'll go home.

00:51:45.500 --> 00:51:49.320
If you come with me, you'll be able to get the royal treasure and the village will remain as it is.

00:51:51.670 --> 00:51:53.560
You're not feeling well, Doris.

00:51:53.660 --> 00:51:56.900
Well, I'll take care of you from now on.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:01.220
If you look closely, don't you have a cute face?

00:52:01.860 --> 00:52:04.190
I thought the daughter of a nobleman was like a monster.

00:52:05.450 --> 00:52:10.970
You still have the energy to listen to your dirty mouth.

00:52:12.130 --> 00:52:16.380
If you're going to scream, you'd better die.

00:52:17.120 --> 00:52:19.280
What are you talking about, kid?

00:52:19.760 --> 00:52:20.370
Kill him!

00:52:22.300 --> 00:52:23.620
I'll kill you for sure.

00:52:23.620 --> 00:52:24.920
All right, I'll kill you.

00:52:25.200 --> 00:52:27.720
Even if you're gone, the white knight will be brought in.

00:52:30.800 --> 00:52:31.360
I'm Kato!

00:52:31.760 --> 00:52:33.170
Doris!

00:52:33.230 --> 00:52:54.010
Seigo...

00:52:54.010 --> 00:52:56.680
I thought you were dead, too.

00:52:57.470 --> 00:52:58.570
I thought I could die, too.

00:52:59.450 --> 00:52:59.890
Rei-chan!

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:00.820
You have to be strong.

00:53:01.460 --> 00:53:03.320
You can't give up at any time.

00:53:04.780 --> 00:53:05.280
You...

00:53:05.280 --> 00:53:16.160
It's not far from the castle. Go home.

00:53:17.200 --> 00:53:18.100
You're not going to kill me?

00:53:18.460 --> 00:53:20.520
Of course not.

00:53:20.720 --> 00:53:22.550
I can't be a coward to kill a woman.

00:53:23.070 --> 00:53:24.840
I'll tell you why I saved you.

00:53:26.290 --> 00:53:27.660
Even if you're a noble,

00:53:27.940 --> 00:53:29.580
you can't kill a man.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:30.600
I can't kill anyone.

00:53:31.600 --> 00:53:32.760
I'm not a mere human being.

00:53:33.800 --> 00:53:34.460
I'm a noble.

00:53:34.800 --> 00:53:38.290
There is no such thing as love or justice in this world.

00:53:38.290 --> 00:53:39.970
There is only the weak and the strong.

00:53:40.270 --> 00:53:44.220
The noble should rule over the humans.

00:53:44.240 --> 00:53:47.250
The weak, the strong, and the strong should rule.

00:53:47.940 --> 00:53:49.320
That's not what your truth is.

00:53:50.450 --> 00:53:51.010
Truth?

00:54:25.052 --> 00:54:25.552
What's wrong?

00:54:28.060 --> 00:54:30.000
I thought I had gone somewhere.

00:54:30.830 --> 00:54:32.960
I'm sorry. I said something terrible.

00:54:33.740 --> 00:54:36.180
I don't care. It's always like this.

00:54:36.460 --> 00:54:37.960
I don't want you to be like your father.

00:54:38.800 --> 00:54:40.780
Just because your father is against it,

00:54:41.160 --> 00:54:41.880
he made you face the vampire.

00:54:43.360 --> 00:54:44.990
I've had enough of fighting.

00:54:45.510 --> 00:54:47.620
Let's live somewhere far away.

00:54:48.990 --> 00:54:50.030
I can't do that.

00:54:50.390 --> 00:54:50.710
Why?

00:54:51.090 --> 00:54:52.960
You'll be more unfortunate than you are now.

00:54:53.510 --> 00:54:54.050
That can't be!

00:54:54.330 --> 00:54:56.480
I... I...

00:54:56.480 --> 00:54:57.410
I don't want you to die!

00:55:00.090 --> 00:55:01.040
I want to stay like this for a while.

00:55:30.540 --> 00:55:58.760
I won't be more honest with you.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:00.800
Do you really think you're so cursed?

00:56:02.340 --> 00:56:05.070
You can't even make a woman's wish come true.

00:56:05.210 --> 00:56:06.130
What's the point of being a man?

00:56:07.810 --> 00:56:09.490
Your father is...

00:56:09.490 --> 00:56:10.010
Shut up!

00:56:10.230 --> 00:56:12.030
Shut up...

00:56:12.030 --> 00:56:17.980
Shio...

00:56:18.580 --> 00:56:21.080
Anyway, this child of Tokidamashi is safe.

00:56:21.660 --> 00:56:22.500
It's a big deal.

00:56:22.960 --> 00:56:24.760
It's you.

00:56:26.100 --> 00:56:27.610
W-Wait for me!

00:56:27.970 --> 00:56:29.280
I won't wait.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:30.440
I'll kill you.

00:57:12.440 --> 00:57:12.660
Wack!

00:57:28.000 --> 00:57:29.730
Last night, I...

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:31.420
I'm sorry to have let you pass through here.

00:57:36.040 --> 00:57:40.710
As expected of you, Sora.

00:58:00.190 --> 00:58:08.500
Huh, Kizuna...

00:58:08.500 --> 00:58:10.080
The eternal young man...

00:58:10.930 --> 00:58:13.260
Ha ha ha ha ha!

00:58:33.680 --> 00:58:35.830
What a guy.

00:58:49.680 --> 00:58:51.560
Hehehe, so this is how you treat your wife.

00:59:54.540 --> 00:59:55.260
You're my daughter, right?

01:00:00.060 --> 01:00:00.920
Please reconsider your decision.

01:00:01.160 --> 01:00:02.750
I can't accept that kind of girl as a noble.

01:00:04.470 --> 01:00:09.900
Ramiika, what happened tonight is just a temporary event in my life.

01:00:10.000 --> 01:00:12.780
I'll be bored of that girl again.

01:00:13.520 --> 01:00:16.150
If that happens, I'll look for a new girl.

01:00:17.200 --> 01:00:18.920
That's what I'm looking forward to.

01:00:19.810 --> 01:00:22.100
Jiu, then I'll get rid of that woman.

01:00:22.740 --> 01:00:24.680
Otherwise, the Li family will be destroyed.

01:00:25.810 --> 01:00:26.990
Ramiika, listen carefully.

01:00:27.740 --> 01:00:28.440
The Li family will be destroyed if we accept a human woman.

01:00:30.030 --> 01:00:30.490
will not be destroyed.

01:00:32.150 --> 01:00:33.550
Because, La Mica,

01:00:33.710 --> 01:00:35.880
your mother, like that girl,

01:00:36.580 --> 01:00:38.350
is a descendant.

01:00:39.670 --> 01:00:46.020
I have lived in this world for about 10,000 years.

01:00:46.840 --> 01:00:47.720
You don't know what that means.

01:00:49.420 --> 01:00:52.070
It's just a time of boredom and boredom.

01:00:53.030 --> 01:00:55.860
To confuse that, just like your mother,

01:00:56.500 --> 01:00:59.480
a fight with a descendant is the best medicine.

01:01:01.400 --> 01:01:08.220
Foolish humans are the first to be able to live a small life by taking over the land.

01:01:09.200 --> 01:01:14.290
If you think about it, it's 50 years, 100 years, and once in a lifetime.

01:01:15.450 --> 01:01:17.060
Jiu, please get rid of that prophecy.

01:01:17.920 --> 01:01:19.640
It's not a prophecy.

01:01:20.120 --> 01:01:22.400
Certainly, your mother is a low-ranking official.

01:01:30.160 --> 01:01:33.930
However, Miko, your height is as tall as a tree.

01:01:34.750 --> 01:01:37.780
However, if you get in the way of the training, you won't be able to do it.

01:01:37.860 --> 01:01:39.740
You should cool your head there for a while.

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:44.950
Master, I want you to keep your promise.

01:01:45.840 --> 01:01:46.400
Promise?

01:01:46.960 --> 01:01:51.260
I will be a member of the noble family and be young forever.

01:01:51.340 --> 01:01:52.170
You fool.

01:01:52.810 --> 01:01:57.140
Think of how lucky you are to have the life you have learned from this journey.

01:01:57.140 --> 01:01:59.240
What is eternal youth?

01:02:00.060 --> 01:02:00.880
You can wait another 50 years.

01:02:03.760 --> 01:02:06.780
10 years?

01:02:14.460 --> 01:02:15.780
I'll take care of you.

01:02:34.430 --> 01:02:36.320
This is strange.

01:02:36.320 --> 01:02:37.080
This is strange.

01:03:08.760 --> 01:03:21.260
What's wrong? Can't you move?

01:03:21.680 --> 01:03:25.700
What's wrong? Can't you breathe?

01:03:26.700 --> 01:03:29.120
Oh, no! He noticed me!

01:03:30.760 --> 01:03:31.460
Hey, what's wrong?

01:03:34.630 --> 01:03:39.040
Move! Move!

01:03:39.310 --> 01:03:39.550
Move!

01:03:41.400 --> 01:03:43.110
What are you doing?

01:03:43.310 --> 01:03:43.490
Huh?

01:03:44.420 --> 01:03:44.720
Argh!

01:03:45.180 --> 01:03:54.610
I'll do it.

01:05:30.250 --> 01:05:32.250
This is the end for you, too.

01:05:32.310 --> 01:05:45.520
We've been waiting for about 50 years.

01:05:45.600 --> 01:05:47.320
What do you think we've been waiting for 50 years?

01:05:48.320 --> 01:05:50.120
I lost my left hand.

01:05:50.260 --> 01:05:51.780
I made all my friends die.

01:05:52.920 --> 01:05:53.700
But that's enough.

01:05:53.900 --> 01:05:56.000
I want you to die here, too.

01:06:03.130 --> 01:06:05.810
Did you think I'd listen to that kind of stuff?

01:06:06.210 --> 01:06:29.510
What a fun-

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:36.000
I can't believe I'm spending such a fulfilling day in my life.

01:06:56.204 --> 01:06:58.204
Thank you for your blessing.

01:07:06.720 --> 01:07:10.000
It's the first time I've ever seen a woman as caring as you.

01:07:11.040 --> 01:07:28.560
Maka!

01:07:33.930 --> 01:07:35.790
The nobles have long since perished.

01:07:35.930 --> 01:07:39.300
The nobles are but temporary guests to this world.

01:07:39.460 --> 01:07:41.360
Temporary guests?

01:07:42.440 --> 01:07:45.200
The nobles and this castle have been forgotten by time.

01:07:45.540 --> 01:07:46.770
Return to the world that suits you!

01:07:48.380 --> 01:07:50.810
What an interesting thing to say.

01:07:51.560 --> 01:07:53.660
You are the Danpeel that our nobles gave birth to in Tamre.

01:07:54.780 --> 01:07:56.350
Do you think you can beat me?

01:07:57.430 --> 01:07:59.920
I can't wait to see you die.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:01.140
I'll take care of it after I get rid of it.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:35.450
I don't know what you think you're doing, but there's no reason for you to defeat a noble.

01:08:35.830 --> 01:08:40.890
I'm going to get rid of you with a different way of thinking.

01:08:40.890 --> 01:08:53.150
I don't know if you've destroyed a noble, but what you've done is murdering a noble.

01:08:53.650 --> 01:08:55.610
Use that sword to kill yourself.

01:09:03.868 --> 01:09:04.128
And you move.

01:09:36.076 --> 01:09:36.576
Huh?

01:10:04.700 --> 01:10:06.620
L-Lami, what are you doing?

01:10:06.780 --> 01:10:07.980
Hurry up and avenge your father!

01:10:08.800 --> 01:10:11.350
Father, please stop it!

01:10:11.570 --> 01:10:13.670
The Iike family will perish!

01:10:14.360 --> 01:10:14.860
Wh-What?

01:10:16.290 --> 01:10:18.490
Ever since you saw your daughter and forgot the pride of a noble!

01:10:20.130 --> 01:10:23.050
You idiot!

01:10:43.440 --> 01:10:46.700
My lord, you are a dead man!

01:11:00.280 --> 01:11:02.140
I will perish in this castle with my father.

01:11:02.240 --> 01:11:04.450
I am not a noble.

01:11:05.110 --> 01:11:06.560
I am a noble.

01:11:06.840 --> 01:11:10.440
It is natural for a noble to follow a noble.

01:11:11.060 --> 01:11:15.110
I am just like you, a mere Dampir.

01:11:16.290 --> 01:11:17.610
You have the blood of a human.

01:11:17.990 --> 01:11:20.120
You can live even if you take off the clothes of a noble.

01:11:21.000 --> 01:11:23.600
I am pure.

01:13:30.510 --> 01:13:30.750
Thanks for watching!

01:17:30.600 --> 01:17:30.980
She's

01:18:30.030 --> 01:18:30.270
Oh, shit.
